Manifest-Version: 1.0
Plugin-Class: org.openstreetmap.josm.plugins.betterworkspace.BetterWorkspacePlugin
Plugin-Description: Adds a BetterWorkspace submenu under More Tools: open a secondary view-only map window synced to the main one, load HOT Tasking Manager task grids, batch-download OSM data around selected/all features, toggle the active layer's visibility, todo list plugin keep completed items visible, additional validator checks, preview quick TMS imagery layers, load Esri World Imagery's acquisition-date grids, reorder the docked side panels,
  and display WebP imagery.
Plugin-Icon: images/betterworkspace/betterworkspace.svg
Plugin-Link: https://github.com/Patrik-Br/BetterWorkspace-JOSM-plugin
Plugin-Mainversion: 19555
Plugin-Canloadatruntime: true
Author: Patrik_B
Plugin-Version: 1.3.5
